    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When you roll Initiative, you can expend one use of your Bardic Inspiration if you don't have the &amp;Reference[Incapacitated] condition. When you do so, roll your Bardic Inspiration die; you and each ally within 30 feet of you who can see or hear you gains a bonus to Initiative equal to the number rolled.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-nQrxfDcx2JC1jNO2\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Using this feature will consume a usage of your Bardic Inspiration.</p></section>",
